#: ../developer/trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md:199
msgid "We do NOT continue to `1.2.3.4` — that would cross the trust boundary."
msgstr "不会再往左读到 `1.2.3.4`——那就越过信任边界了。"

#: ../developer/trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md:201
